</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1203" data-end="1422">Police stated that the college maintained files, records, and printing tools used to manufacture these fake documents. Several employees, including officials associated with the institution, are now under investigation.</p></div><div class="inner-section ms-4 mt-2 p-2 bg-light rounded"><h5 class="inner-title">How the Scam Operated</h5><div class="inner-content"><p data-start="1453" data-end="1503">According to investigators, the college allegedly:</p>
<ul data-start="1505" data-end="1818">
<li data-start="1505" data-end="1551">
<p data-start="1507" data-end="1551">Charged around <strong data-start="1522" data-end="1549">₹30,000 per fake degree</strong></p>
