</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1820" data-end="1926">This means people without any medical training were able to present themselves as qualified practitioners.</p></div></div><div class="inner-section ms-4 mt-2 p-2 bg-light rounded"><h5 class="inner-title">Impact on Public Safety</h5><div class="inner-content"><p data-start="1959" data-end="1995">The scandal raises serious concerns:</p>
<ul data-start="1997" data-end="2278">
<li data-start="1997" data-end="2075">
<p data-start="1999" data-end="2075">Patients could have been treated by <strong data-start="2035" data-end="2073">untrained, unqualified individuals</strong></p>
